sequence-diagram
typeface clean
styleMode plain

Recruiter [icon: user]
Web [icon: react]
API [icon: java]
S3 [icon: aws-simple-storage-service]
Supabase [icon: database, label: "Supabase PostgreSQL"]
SQS [icon: aws-simple-queue-service]
Worker [icon: aws-fargate]
AiRouter [label: "AI Provider Router"]
Grok [label: "xAI Grok"]
Gemini [icon: google-gemini, label: "Gemini fallback"]

Recruiter > Web: Upload CSV and ZIP
Web > API: Create import
API > S3: Create presigned uploads
API > Supabase: Save import job
Web > S3: Upload bundle
Web > API: Request validation
API > SQS: Publish validation request
SQS > Worker: Consume validation
Worker > S3: Scan and parse bundle
Worker > Supabase: Save preview rows
Recruiter > Web: Confirm valid rows
Web > API: Confirm with idempotency key
API > Supabase: Create candidates applications and outbox
API > SQS: Publish resume work
SQS > Worker: Parse clean resume
Worker > AiRouter: Send text and structured rubric
AiRouter > Grok: Preferred when funded
Grok > AiRouter: Structured assessment
AiRouter --> Gemini: Optional configured fallback
Gemini --> AiRouter: Structured assessment
AiRouter > Worker: Validated internal assessment or unavailable
Worker > Supabase: Save assessment/failure and activity
Web > API: Poll review queue
API > Web: Ranked evidence-bearing results
